    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present Ivy Cottage, a charming and characterful two-bedroom cottage ideally positioned on Meath Place, just off the prestigious Meath Road in the heart of Bray.\n\nBehind its pretty cottage façade lies a wonderfully inviting home where original period character blends beautifully with modern finishes. Vaulted ceilings enhance the sense of space throughout, while original cast-iron fireplace provide a lovely reminder of the cottage's heritage and add real personality to the interior.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming living/dining room, a modern fitted kitchen, two bedrooms and a fully tiled bathroom. The kitchen is finished in a contemporary style with a classic subway-tiled splashback, while the bathroom benefits from a large Velux window which allows an abundance of natural light to flood the space.\n\nTo the rear is a private east-facing courtyard, providing a lovely spot to enjoy the morning sun. A block-built storage shed offers valuable additional storage space. Further features of the property include double-glazed uPVC windows and doors and gas-fired central heating.\nWithout doubt, one of the standout features of Ivy Cottage is its exceptional location. Meath Road is one of Bray's most established and prestigious residential addresses, and the property enjoys the considerable advantage of having virtually everything the town has to offer within easy walking distance.\n\nBray DART Station is just a 3-minute walk away, providing superb connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond. Bray's famous seafront and promenade are also only moments away, offering beautiful coastal walks along with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants and leisure amenities.\n\nBray Main Street and the town centre are within a short stroll, placing shops, supermarkets, restaurants, cafés and everyday amenities practically on your doorstep. It is this combination of a highly regarded address, coastal lifestyle and outstanding transport links that makes Ivy Cottage such an appealing place to call home.\n\nFor downsizers, the property presents an opportunity to enjoy a charming, manageable home with everything close at hand, while first-time buyers will appreciate the rare opportunity to secure a character-filled property in such a central and desirable Bray location.\n\nFull of warmth and personality, Ivy Cottage offers far more than its charming exterior might suggest. With its vaulted ceilings, modern finishes and unbeatable location, this is a delightful home that is sure to capture the attention of buyers seeking something a little different.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Charming two-bedroom cottage full of character\n• Highly sought-after setting just off prestigious Meath Road\n• Just a 3-minute walk from Bray DART Station\n• Moments from Bray seafront and promenade\n• Original cast-iron fireplace\n• Gas-fired central heating\n• Private east-facing rear courtyard style garden\n• Bray Main Street and town centre within easy walking distance\n• Excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and amenities nearby\n• Superb public transport links to Dublin City Centre\n• Ideal choice for first-time buyers or downsizers\n• Characterful home in one of Bray's most convenient and desirable locations"
      },
